Package: lnxsum
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sequential hashing utility with time-trap hardening
 LNX-256 (lnxsum) provides a secure, deterministic hash 
 that is mathematically resistant to supercomputer 
 brute-forcing through 512k sequential mixing cycles.
